{"type":"message","id":"e74fab5a","parentId":"b97a9b95","timestamp":"2026-05-01T03:34:27.546Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Claude Code v2.1.126 is installed. The `claude.exe` is a Bun self-contained binary that should run Claude Code when executed. The fact that it shows Bun's help page instead suggests the binary might be corrupted or there's some issue with the packaging.\n\nLet me try running the native Node.js version instead. The package also has a `cli.js` file.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_3vFWb9g5WHLKm4qaqxdgEhWe","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"Get-ChildItem \"C:\\Users\\zhang\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\@anthropic-ai\\claude-code\\\" -Filter \"*.js\" | Select-Object Name; Get-ChildItem \"C:\\Users\\zhang\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\@anthropic-ai\\claude-code\\bin\\\" | Select-Object Name","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom-customad","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":98,"output":302,"cacheRead":38656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39056,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777606460560,"responseId":"7630a62b-b160-4a10-b43c-927b35bf3459"}}
